Doom engine sources in this directory are derived from:
  - ozkl/doomgeneric (Chocolate Doom / doomgeneric), GPLv2
  - rear16/ESP-DOOM (shutdown path, CMAP256, ESP-oriented fixes), GPLv2
  - id Software Doom (GPLv2)

Solana OS platform glue (doom_app.c, doom_host.c, doomgeneric_solana.c)
is separate and not part of the Doom engine.
